!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/link/invalid/a-choice-variant-that-is-an-extern-of-a-choice-not-disjoint-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/link-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.4, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.13"
  description: """
    Whether a variant is a choice is judged of the entry it reaches, through an extern as through an alias, an
    extern being a hop and every judgement through it made of its target. `either_x` reaches extern-choices.tn's
    `either`, a choice of two records that is not disjoint, so `( text | either_x )` is refused as a choice
    holding `either` is in the schema that declares it: a value of the variant carries the tag naming `either_x`,
    and with its one tag spent nothing selects `a` or `b`. A resolver error at the declaration. A resolver that
    stops at the extern loads a choice holding values no document writes.
    """
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
